 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24e05e7a-a92d-5b4e-a8f9-18c896918199', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24e05e7a-a92d-5b4e-a8f9-18c896918199'}, {'abstract': 'Maman in TriBeCa and Greenpoint, Brooklyn, offers ice creams from the Santa Barbara, Calif.-based McConnell’s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/03/dining/mcconnells-ice-cream-maman-nyc.html', 'snippet': 'Maman in TriBeCa and Greenpoint, Brooklyn, offers ice creams from the Santa Barbara, Calif.-based McConnell’s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This summer, two Maman cafes are serving McConnell’s Fine Ice Creams from Santa Barbara, Calif. Six flavors are available in cups or waffle cones from a cart at Maman in TriBeCa. Sandwiches made with vanilla ice cream and unbaked chocolate-chip cookie dough will also be sold at the cart and at Maman’s location in Greenpoint, Brooklyn: Ice cream, $4 to $8, Maman TriBeCa, 211 West Broadway (Franklin Street); Maman Greenpoint, 80 Kent Street (Franklin Street), mamannyc.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/dining/03burnericecream1/03burnericecream1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/03/dining/03burnericecream1/03burnericecream1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/dining/03burnericecream1/03burnericecream1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/dining/03burnericecream1/03burnericecream1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 20