nces and whip up a dinner in the model kitchen before committing to your home improvement purchases. Over at the Apartment by the Line you can rifle through closets and dresser drawers stocked with clothing from burgeoning labels such as Protagonist and Khaite, then take the dresser itself, charge and carry. Or perhaps you’d prefer to retire to an elegant Upper East Side townhouse — courtesy of the Row — and check out the brand’s latest offerings nestled among a fantasy collection of Keith Harings and Basquiats.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '107', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/02/t-magazine/shopping-home-slide-WIIF/shopping-home-slide-WIIF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/02/t-magazine/shopping-home-slide-WIIF/shopping-home-slide-WIIF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/02/t-magazine/shopping-home-slide-WIIF/shopping-home-slide-WIIF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/02/t-magazine/shopping-home-slide-WIIF/shopping-home-slide-WIIF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/02/t-magazine/shopping-home-slide-WIIF/shopping-home-slide-WIIF-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/02/t-magazine/shopping-home-slide-WIIF/shopping-home-slide-WIIF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jum