s.com/2016/08/07/travel/five-places-to-go-in-seattle.html', 'snippet': 'As Seattle becomes increasingly unaffordable, unincorporated White Center is attracting a diverse blend of residents and entrepreneurs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Seattle becomes increasingly unaffordable to those raking in less than six figures, White Center, the unincorporated suburb to its south, has attracted a soulful blend of entrepreneurs, striking an elusive balance between gritty and friendly. It has an uncommonly diverse mix of residents and restaurants and a staggering number of pinball machines per capita. Some of its adult-oriented businesses — pornography, poker and marijuana — speak to its rough-and-tumble roots, flourishing there because of the tight restrictions of its more affluent neighbor to the north.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/travel/07SURFACING1SUB/07SURFACING1SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/07/travel/07SURFACING1SUB/07SURFACING1SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/travel/07SURFACING1SUB/07SURFACING1SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/travel/07SURFACING1SUB/07SURFACING1SUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/travel/07SURFACING1SUB/07SURFACING1SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':