of instant everything, there’s a renewed power — and even status — in delayed gratification.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting-as-luxury.html', 'snippet': 'In an age of instant everything, there’s a renewed power — and even status — in delayed gratification.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the Tudor era, a lady-in-waiting provided “noble counsel” to the queen and could become the king’s mistress or even, after a clutch beheading, the king’s new wife. “In waiting” status gave such a woman access, power, clout. Meaning, even to be granted the opportunity to wait — to be possibly married to the king and maybe subsequently beheaded — was considered a great privilege.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '174', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting2/waiting2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 829, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting2/waiting2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 829}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting2/waiting2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 742, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting2/waiting2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1483, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting2/waiting2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/03/t-magazine/waiting2/waiting2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth