nternational Herald Tribune: The Washington Post buys a 45 percent interest in the European edition of the New York Herald Tribune, August 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The oldest American newspaper published in Europe will have a new and broader base of ownership with the acquisition by The Washington Post of a 45 percent interest in the European edition of the New York Herald Tribune, it was announced today. Joint publication of the paper — to be called the International Edition of the New York Herald Tribune-The Washington Post — will begin in the fall, after completion of necessary legal formalities. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/blogs/05iht-retrospective-WP/05iht-retrospective-WP-thumbStandard-v3.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/05/blogs/05iht-retrospective-WP/05iht-retrospective-WP-thumbStandard-v3.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/blogs/05iht-retrospective-WP/05iht-retrospective-WP-thumbLarge-v3.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/blogs/05iht-retrospective-WP/05iht-retrospective-WP-articleLarge-v3.png', 'height': 135, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/05/blogs/05iht-retrospective-WP/05iht-retrospective-WP-articleLarge-v3.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 135}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/blogs/05iht-retrospective-WP/05iht-retrospective-WP-jumbo-v3.png', 'height': 172, 'width': 766, 'sub