imes.com/slideshow/2016/08/04/t-magazine/art/mary-woronov-warhol-paintings-lodge-gallery.html', 'snippet': 'The artist, writer, actress and illustrator (and alum of Warhol’s Factory) has a new show up at the of-the-moment Los Angeles gallery the Lodge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The artist, writer, actress and illustrator (and alum of Warhol’s Factory) has a new show up at the of-the-moment Los Angeles gallery the Lodge.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 604}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1018, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2036, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/04/t-magazine/04-woronov-slide-NE34/04-woronov-slide-NE34-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mary Woronov’s “Imaginary Reality” Paintings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-08-04T16:18:10+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/5f8864af-1c33-549a-bd9b-1bfe230a9d66', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/5f8864af-1c33-549a-bd9b-1bfe230a9d66'}, {'abstract': 'The actress, writer, illustrator and artist Mary Woronov’s vibrant, emotive paintings are now on view at the Lodge, a building owned by Ed Ruscha.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/04/t-magazine/art/mary-woronov-warhol-painter-lodge-gallery.html', 'snippet': 'The actress, writer, illustrator and artist Mary Woronov’s vibrant, emotive paintings are now on view at the Lodge, a building owned by Ed Ruscha.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While studying sculpture at Cornell in 1963, Mary Woronov met Gerard Malanga, the Warhol confidant and chief gatekeeper of Andy Warhol’s Factory. Before long, she was performing as Hanoi Hannah in Warhol’s “Chelsea Girls” and in leather and whips in the Velvet Underground’s dance troupe, The Exploding Plastic Inevitable. A multihyphenate long before it became a buzzword, the cult actress, writer, illustrator and artist would become one of the most indelible figures to emerge from the early years of the Factory. And while some of the passages in her autobiography, “Swimming Underground,” suggest a dystopian world, Woronov sees the Warhol years as the most nurturing and formative of her life. “I have a very dark side, I can’t help it, but to me that period was wine and roses. It was darkness with pinpoints of light,” she says. “My connection with Warhol was sort of like Lancelot’s connection to King Arthur.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Under-the-Radar Warhol Alum, at One of Los Angeles’s Coolest Galleries', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruscha, Edward', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warhol, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woronov, Mary', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hollywood (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Chelsea Girls (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-04T16:18:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aaron Peasley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aaron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Peasley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3936aea1-6efa-5092-82dc-86b6b12bcb4a', 'word_count': 462, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3936aea1-6efa-5092-82dc-86b6b12bcb4a'}, {'abstract': 'The season’s styles, from maxi skirts and lean knits to bomber jackets and boots made for stomping, are full of teen spirit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/08/04/t-magazine/fashion/90s-fall-fashion-trends.html', 'snippet': 'The season’s styles, from maxi skirts and lean knits to bomber jackets and boots made for stomping, are full of teen spirit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The season’s styles, from maxi skirts and lean knits to bomber jackets and boots made for stomping, are full of teen spirit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit