t at an East London disco is being shown as a short feature.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1984 the director Ron Peck asked a friend and colleague, Derek Jarman, to record test footage for a proposed feature project. About 100 nightclubbers of all stripes, many of them regular patrons of the East London disco where the test was to be shot, were invited, and presumably instructed to act naturally. For that reason, the material that Mr. Jarman captured — recently rediscovered by Mr. Peck and being shown now as a short feature titled “Will You Dance With Me?” — feels like, well, a night out at a tackily appointed, friendly dance club, documented by a regular who’s not intruding on anybody’s fun.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/arts/will-image/will-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/05/arts/will-image/will-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/arts/will-image/will-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/arts/will-image/will-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/05/arts/will-image/will-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/05/arts/will-image/will-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail