://article/1f9b36eb-7683-5e3b-8f98-2b2e09c81650'}, {'abstract': 'When Americans gloated about winning the Cold War, they opened a door for Russians’ resentment — and Putin’s tactics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/06/opinion/for-putin-disinformation-is-power.html', 'snippet': 'When Americans gloated about winning the Cold War, they opened a door for Russians’ resentment — and Putin’s tactics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Fifteen years ago, a few months into his presidency, Vladimir V. Putin told Larry King on CNN that his previous job as a K.G.B. officer had been like that of a journalist. “They have the same purpose of gathering information, synthesizing it and presenting it for the consumption of decision makers,” he said. Since then, he has excelled at using the media to consolidate power inside Russia and, increasingly, to wage an information war against the West.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/06/opinion/06ostrovskyINYT/06ostrovskyINYT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/06/opinion/06ostrovskyINYT/06ostrovskyINYT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/06/opinion/06ostrovskyINYT/06ostrovskyINYT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/06/opinion/06ostrovskyINYT/06ostrovskyINYT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1403, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/06/opinion/06ostrovskyINYT/06ostrovskyINY