liar in the annals of authoritarian governments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/06/opinion/show-trials-in-china.html', 'snippet': 'The campaign against legal activists is part of a pattern that’s dismally familiar in the annals of authoritarian governments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday it was Zhou Shifeng’s turn to take the stage in the Chinese inquisition. A lawyer who worked with people who challenged the Communist Party, he was charged with “spreading subversive thoughts” under the influence of “anti-China forces” and sentenced to seven years in prison.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Show Trials in China', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Show Trials in China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Prisoners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-05T12:27:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2aebe7bd-c8cd-5483-9820-d318fb1d7de9', 'word_count': 440, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2aebe7bd-c8cd-5483-9820-d318fb1d7de9'}, {'abstract': 'Swipe the card. Nope. Dip the card? Maybe. Feel like an idiot? Definitely.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/06/business/chip-credit-cards-for-dummies.html', 'snippet': 'Swipe the card. Nope. Dip the card? Maybe. Feel like an idiot? Definitely.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You’re at the checkout counter. Your items have been bagged. Your credit card is in your hand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarg