35, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2e6d13d-520a-5a8b-bbcd-de9e0aaddb07'}, {'abstract': 'Uneasy relationships feature in the three one-act plays in Series B of this 59E59 Theaters festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/08/theater/review-a-femme-fatale-a-private-eye-and-dorm-mates-at-summer-shorts.html', 'snippet': 'Uneasy relationships feature in the three one-act plays in Series B of this 59E59 Theaters festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By the time things turn dizzily theatrical, in a noir-style romp called “The Dark Clothes of Night,” the audience is well primed. This delicious little play, by Richard Alfredo, is the third of three one-acts in Series B of this year’s Summer Shorts festival at 59E59 Theaters, and it’s the first that feels unmistakably like a work for the stage — dressed up though it is as a love letter to classic cinema.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/arts/08SUMSHORTS/08SUMSHORTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/08/arts/08SUMSHORTS/08SUMSHORTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/arts/08SUMSHORTS/08SUMSHORTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/arts/08SUMSHORTS/08SUMSHORTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/arts/08SUMSHORTS/08SUMSHORTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy