eye to a pressing need in his state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/08/opinion/a-message-to-a-stingy-governor.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Jay Nixon of Missouri, by slashing the budget for public defenders, has turned a blind eye to a pressing need in his state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Considering the hard-pressed criminal justice system of Missouri — a crisis laid bare by the police shooting and civil unrest in Ferguson in 2014 — the last thing Gov. Jay Nixon should be doing is stinting on support of the state public defender system, which provides counsel to indigent defendants.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/08/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/08/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/08/opinion/08mon3web/08mon3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '