 Jorgensen and\xa0Clark Burck...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2016 Rio Olympics have begun, unleashing\xa0Hungarian swimmer Katinka Hosszu, American shooter Ginny Thrasher, and a whole pack of Brazilian gymnasts. I’ve enjoyed the Times’ coverage, including the\xa0Interactive Stories series and the SMS experiment. It was also\xa0a nice surprise\xa0to find\xa0Karen Crouse’s\xa0story about\xa0Bruce Gemmell, an old college teammate of mine and current coach of swimmer\xa0Katie Ledecky. I’ve spent as much time immersed in water as enveloped by math problems, and it’s good to see so many friends and\xa0fast swims down in Rio. (Well done with the flag, MP!)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/crosswords/Antonick-Jorgensen/Antonick-Jorgensen-jumbo.png', 'height': 281, 'width': 365, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/crosswords/Antonick-Jorgensen/Antonick-Jorgensen-superJumbo.png', 'height': 281, 'width': 365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/crosswords/Antonick-Jorgensen/Antonick-Jorgensen-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/07/crosswords/Antonick-Jorgensen/Antonick-Jorgensen-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/07/crosswords/Antonick-Jorgensen/Antonick-Jorgensen-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Olympic Strategies, Part 1', 'kicker': 'Wordpla