-9a46-96346b72bfdf'}, {'abstract': 'Yulia Efimova, King’s rival who served a 16-month doping suspension, secured silver.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/09/sports/olympics/lilly-king-yulia-efimova-swimming-breaststroke.html', 'snippet': 'Yulia Efimova, King’s rival who served a 16-month doping suspension, secured silver.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — A movement that has been gathering steam at the Olympic Aquatics Stadium was ready for its hashtag on Monday night. The Clean Athletes Matter brigade found a ready, able and ardent leader: Lilly King of the United States, who entered the Rio Games with the top time in the world in the women’s 100-meter breaststroke.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/09/sports/09SWIMdress-1470709406810/09SWIMdress-1470709406810-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/09/sports/09SWIMdress-1470709406810/09SWIMdress-1470709406810-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/09/sports/09SWIMdress-1470709406810/09SWIMdress-1470709406810-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/09/sports/09SWIMdress-1470709406810/09SWIMdress-1470709406810-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1083, 'width': 1478, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/09/sports/09SWIMdress-1470709406810/09SWIMdress-1470709406810-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'sub