 1916.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — M. Justin Godart, Under-Secretary of State for the Military Health Service, inaugurated yesterday afternoon [Aug. 8] at the Maison-Blanche, Neuilly-sur-Marne, a new institution for ‘‘re-educating’’ maimed soldiers. Its organization is due to the initiative of the Union des Colonies Etrangères en France, which comprises eighteen groups of friendly foreign colonies. The school is divided into two sections, one for teaching French, English, book-keeping, shorthand, typewriting, etc., and the other for manual labor, with workrooms devoted to a large variety of trades and occupations. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Aug. 10, 1916', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/blogs/10iht-retrospective-ecole/10iht-retrospective-ecole-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/10/blogs/10iht-retrospective-ecole/10iht-retrospective-ecole-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/blogs/10iht-retrospective-ecole/10iht-retrospective-ecole-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/blogs/10iht-retrospective-ecole/10iht-retrospective-ecole-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 870, 'width': 1380, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/blogs/10iht-retrospective-ecole/10iht-retrospective-ecole-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'