ract': 'The killings, one in Massachusetts and the other in Queens, have put many female runners on edge, and some no longer feel comfortable jogging alone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/10/nyregion/vanessa-marcotte-karina-vetrano.html', 'snippet': 'The killings, one in Massachusetts and the other in Queens, have put many female runners on edge, and some no longer feel comfortable jogging alone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The two deaths occurred just days apart and had eerily similar details — each time, a woman went jogging during the day in an isolated area and wound up dead.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/10JOGGER2/10JOGGER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/10JOGGER2/10JOGGER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/10JOGGER2/10JOGGER2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/10JOGGER2/10JOGGER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/10JOGGER2/10JOGGER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/10JOGGER2/10JOGGER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type