 13, 2013. Ms. Renna accused Mr. Christie of lying about his staff members not having knowledge of the George Washington Bridge lane closings.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings-thumbStandard.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings-thumbStandard.gif', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings-thumbLarge.gif', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 234, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 234}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/10/nyregion/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings/christina-renna-chris-christie-bridge-lane-closings-jumbo.gif', 'height': 307, 'width': 786, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': No