e development with the Search team — before I ever stepped in the building — I assumed I’d be working on small projects, fixing bugs that needed to be fixed, and essentially coding only in whatever spare quantity was required. I was perfectly happy to do so, of course, but I was quite prepared to receive piecemeal assignments for completion in small fragments of time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Searching for Feelings — An Intern Works on Topic and Sentiment Analysis', 'kicker': 'Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Internships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-10T17:13:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isaac Pena', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isaac', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pena', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bf156b2-0877-5e21-929b-7f46aea68ecf', 'word_count': 655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bf156b2-0877-5e21-929b-7f46aea68ecf'}, {'abstract': 'Sarah DeLappe’s play focuses on coming of age, the closed ranks of a longtime unit and the loneliness of being an outsider.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/14/theater/the-wolves-uses-soccer-to-visit-a-world-of-teenage-girls.html', 'snippet': 'Sarah DeLappe’s play focuses on coming of age, the closed ranks of a longtime unit and the loneliness of being an outsider.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The afternoon of the soccer scrimmage was sweltering, one of those beastly July days with humidity like a damp rag. On the Vassar College campus in Poughkeepsie, N.Y., hours before they took the stage at the Powerh