ce40cca7b02'}, {'abstract': 'At a rooftop bar in Rockville Centre, N.Y., women must be at least 25 to enter and men, 30. The owners say they can make their own rules; some say the policy is discriminatory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/11/nyregion/a-long-island-bars-age-policy-differs-for-men-and-women-is-it-legal.html', 'snippet': 'At a rooftop bar in Rockville Centre, N.Y., women must be at least 25 to enter and men, 30. The owners say they can make their own rules; some say the policy is discriminatory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROCKVILLE CENTRE, N.Y. — It is a nightly ritual. Men and women head to the rooftop bar at Kasey’s Kitchen and Cocktails here on Long Island, only to be turned away because they are not old enough. But there is a quirk in the establishment’s policy for its rooftop bar, which states men must be at least 30 and women, just 25.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/nyregion/11LICLUB1/11LICLUB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/11/nyregion/11LICLUB1/11LICLUB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/nyregion/11LICLUB1/11LICLUB1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/nyregion/11LICLUB1/11LICLUB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/11/nyregion/11LICLUB1/11LICLUB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo',