ursday with the American women heavily favored.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/sports/olympics/gymnastics-simone-biles-aly-raisman-all-around.html', 'snippet': 'What to look for as the competition begins Thursday with the American women heavily favored.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Simone Biles brought down the house at the Rio Games on Tuesday as she and her American teammates handily won the gold medal in the women’s gymnastics team final. Biles, who is considered the best in the world in her sport, is likely to collect a second gold Thursday in the all-around final, the crown jewel of Olympic gymnastics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/sports/11GYMNASTICS1/11GYMNASTICS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/11/sports/11GYMNASTICS1/11GYMNASTICS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/sports/11GYMNASTICS1/11GYMNASTICS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/sports/11GYMNASTICS1/11GYMNASTICS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/11/sports/11GYMNASTICS1/11GYMNASTICS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/11/sports/11GYMNASTICS1/11GYMNASTICS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capti