, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45854ee8-c4f7-5929-bf29-a2441a722281'}, {'abstract': 'The stricken areas included the coastal resort of Hua Hin and the island of Phuket. A Thai official called the attacks the work of “the same network.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/world/asia/thailand-bombings-hua-hin-phuket.html', 'snippet': 'The stricken areas included the coastal resort of Hua Hin and the island of Phuket. A Thai official called the attacks the work of “the same network.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — A series of bombings struck five provinces in Thailand, mostly at sites popular with tourists, on Thursday and Friday morning, in what a senior Thai official called a coordinated wave of attacks. Four people were killed and dozens wounded, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thailand Bombings Kill 4 and Wound Dozens, Most at Tourist Sites', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Casualties in Thailand as Bombs Hit Resort Areas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hua Hin (Thailand)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Phuket (Thailand)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-11T20:52:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Poypiti Amatatham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Poypiti', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amatatham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material