Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twenty One Pilots (Music Group)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Garden', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Blurryface (Album)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-11T21:13:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caryn Ganz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ganz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/41f4a47d-8387-503c-832b-b6b935e2ea4a', 'word_count': 624, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41f4a47d-8387-503c-832b-b6b935e2ea4a'}, {'abstract': 'Paintings from the most private royal chambers are on view at the Clark Art Institute.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/arts/design/now-showing-porn-fit-for-spanish-kings.html', 'snippet': 'Paintings from the most private royal chambers are on view at the Clark Art Institute.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WILLIAMSTOWN, Mass. — “Splendor, Myth and Vision: Nudes From the Prado,” a weighty but also steamy exhibition at the Clark Art Institute here, makes a tricky demand: Can you look at art with both a historian’s detachment and a lover’s intimacy? Stripped-down white cube galleries have conditioned us to look with dispassion upon paintings like the large-scale ones here, which depict goddesses and nymphs, heroines and victims, with full breasts and bountiful thighs. (There are a few boys, too, in the homestretch.) We look at the handling of figures, at angles and light, at the development of painterly style, or else at the political and social context that gave rise to them.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PRADO1-web/12PRADO1-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Now Showing: Porn Fit for Spanish Kings', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Berkshire Nudes. Cape Cod Pilgrims.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farago, Jason', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clark, Sterling and Francine, Art Institute', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name