7'}, {'abstract': 'The Netflix series takes the strivers, spitfires and gang bangers of that film and repurposes them in a tale of the origins of hip-hop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/arts/television/review-netflix-get-down-baz-luhrmann.html', 'snippet': 'The Netflix series takes the strivers, spitfires and gang bangers of that film and repurposes them in a tale of the origins of hip-hop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are, perhaps, less likely pairings than Baz Luhrmann and the story of hip-hop’s beginnings  in the South Bronx in the 1970s. Britain and the European Union. Jackie Kennedy and Aristotle Onassis. Red wine and fish.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12GETDOWN/12GETDOWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12GETDOWN/12GETDOWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12GETDOWN/12GETDOWN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12GETDOWN/12GETDOWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12GETDOWN/12GETDOWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12GETDOWN/12GETDOWN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'capt