ee82cda6fd', 'word_count': 975, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f8ac617-5aa0-5afe-ab7b-31ee82cda6fd'}, {'abstract': 'Four members of the 2008 Olympic team, including the former all-around champion, are part of the network’s coverage in Rio.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/sports/olympics/nbc-gymnastics-television-rio-games.html', 'snippet': 'Four members of the 2008 Olympic team, including the former all-around champion, are part of the network’s coverage in Rio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eight years after they won medals in gymnastics at the Summer Olympics in Beijing, four members of the United States team are working for NBC Sports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1398, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12SANDOMIRWEB1/12SANDOMIRWEB1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In NBC Gymnastics Booth, the Voices of Experience', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2016)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC Sports Network', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-11T22:04:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/225ea016-cbd4-58db-b37c-02847653053e', 'word_count': 608, 'uri': 'nyt://article/225ea016-cbd4-58db-b37c-02847653053e'}, {'abstract': 'Both sides are addressed in this documentary, which largely focuses on viewpoints and personal experiences in Missouri and Illinois.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/movies/abortion-stories-women-tell-review.html', 'snippet': 'Both sides are addressed in this documentary, which largely focuses on viewpoints and personal experiences in Missouri and Illinois.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Tracy Droz Tragos’s documentary “Abortion: Stories Women Tell,” the narratives spill out along with the tears from women who have had abortions as well as those who are fighting to make them illegal. But most striking are clinic patients who felt bereft of anyone to confide in at the time of their pregnancies, and who want to reassure others that they are not alone. A college-bound 17-year-old, for one, says she feared breaking her grandmother’s heart. A woman with a physically abusive husband simply had no one to tell.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Beyond the Politics in ‘Abortion: Stories Women Tell’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Review: Beyond the Politics in ‘Abortion: Stories Women Tell’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Abortion: Stories Women Tell (Movie)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tragos, Tracy Droz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-11T22:07:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helen T. Verongos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helen', 'middlename': 'T.', 'lastname': 'Verongos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/879191ff-553c-5b69-9f8c-4fe8d86b7818', 'word_count': 339, 'uri': 'nyt://article/879191ff-553c-5b69-9f8c-4fe8d86b7818'}, {'abstract': 'This reboot from the director David Lowery tells its standard-issue story at a nice clip.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/12/movies/petes-dragon-review.html', 'snippet': 'This reboot from the director David Lowery tells its standard-issue story at a nice clip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the period between Walt Disney’s death in 1966 and the ostensible renaissance signaled by “The Little Mermaid” (1989), the Walt Disney film studio released dozens of fair-to-middling children’s entertainments.  “Pete’s Dragon,” a 1977 live-action-with-animation musical fantasy co-starring the pop singer Helen Reddy, was one such item — a movie that evinces fond and mild nostalgia from those who saw it as children, but hardly the awe with which those viewers’ parents remembered “Bambi.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/arts/12PETESDRAGON1/12PETESDRAGON1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 858, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Pete’s Dragon,’ a Magical Bond in Peril Again', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None