istory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hanif Mohammad, a Pakistani cricketer who earned the nickname the Little Master for his batting prowess and his stamina, skills that produced a record-setting, 16-plus-hour turn at bat in 1958, died on Thursday at a hospital in his hometown, Karachi. He was 81.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 775}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 793, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1586, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/sports/12MohammadWEB/12MohammadWEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hanif Mohammad, Pakistani Cricket’s Little Master, Dies at 81', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': N