cluding beautiful soaps, kaleidoscopic workout clothes — and smoothies on your doorstep.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In TriBeCa, the newly opened Ethan Rose salon delivers a blowout, manicure and pedicure in a single (leisurely) hour, for just $100. The salon’s owner, Crystal Torres, created the service with her busy, ever-on-the-go clientele in mind — and decked out the lower level exclusively for the three-in-one experience. The vibe is chill, neighborhood residents get a discount on everything — and there’s (free) wine. 5 Harrison Street, ethanrosesalon.com. — ALAINNA LEXIE BEDDIE', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/t-magazine/12tmag-thingseditorslike02/12tmag-thingseditorslike02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/12/t-magazine/12tmag-thingseditorslike02/12tmag-thingseditorslike02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/t-magazine/12tmag-thingseditorslike02/12tmag-thingseditorslike02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/t-magazine/12tmag-thingseditorslike02/12tmag-thingseditorslike02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/12/t-magazine/12tmag-thingseditorslike02/12tmag-thingseditorslike02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/12/t-magazine/12tmag-thingseditorslike02/12tmag-thingseditorslike02-jumbo.jpg',