act in his answer,” which taught Johnston, formerly a reporter at The Times and a Pulitzer Prize winner, something he hopes his readers will learn too: “Donald doesn’t know anything.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/14/books/review/14inside-list-johnston/14inside-list-johnston-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 456, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/14/books/review/14inside-list-johnston/14inside-list-johnston-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 456, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/14/books/review/14inside-list-johnston/14inside-list-johnston-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/14/books/review/14inside-list-johnston/14inside-list-johnston-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/14/books/review/14inside-list-johnston/14inside-list-johnston-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside the List', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inside the List', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnston, David Cay', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-12T17:06:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books'