}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Herman led his field of research in demonstrating dolphins’ ability to understand language, and taught two dozen words to two bottlenose dolphins.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/13/science/louis-herman-who-talked-with-dolphins-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Herman led his field of research in demonstrating dolphins’ ability to understand language, and taught two dozen words to two bottlenose dolphins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Louis M. Herman, whose seminal research demonstrated that dolphins could understand and respond to language transmitted by sound and visual signals, and whose research survived the criminal release of two trained dolphins by disgruntled former employees, died on Aug. 3 in Honolulu. He was 86.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 888, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 888}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/13/us/13HERMAN-obit-2/13HERMAN-obit-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1385, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Louis Herman, Who Talked With Dolphins, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Louis M. Herman, 86; Talked With Dolphins', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dolphins and Porpoises', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Hawaii', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herman, Louis M (1930-2016)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-13T01:27:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e2eb919-bd76-54ff-aa0d-31d99c7ba963', 'word_count': 992, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e2eb919-bd76-54ff-aa0d-31d99c7ba963'}, {'abstract': 'Ledecky becomes the first Olympian since Debbie Meyer to win the 200-, 400- and 800-meter freestyle events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/13/sports/olympics/katie-ledecky-800-freestyle-gold.html', 'snippet': 'Ledecky becomes the first Olympian since Debbie Meyer to win the 200-, 400- and 800-meter freestyle events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1968, a teenager in North Dakota watched transfixed as Debbi