 ‘‘hard line’’ at home and abroad, said a Radio Peking broadcast monitored here. The committee, which ended its 12-day meeting in Peking Friday, announced its decisions on the domestic service of Radio Peking yesterday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1966: Chinese Communists to Make ‘New Leap Forward’', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'CHINA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Communism (Theory and Philosophy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vietnam War', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-14T14:02:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa48ccab-d015-5261-b16a-57594e220db0', 'word_count': 148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa48ccab-d015-5261-b16a-57594e220db0'}, {'abstract': 'No state is more central to the Republican candidate’s uphill quest than Pennsylvania, which has voted Democratic in the last six presidential elections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/15/us/politics/for-trump-pennsylvania-is-a-crucial-battleground.html', 'snippet': 'No state is more central to the Republican candidate’s uphill quest than Pennsylvania, which has voted Democratic in the last six presidential elections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lunch group in Monessen, Pa., is evenly divided between Donald J. Trump supporters and Trump opponents. But the dark mood across the whole room suggests why this working-class town might end up favoring him in November.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'ra