ce of foil heated from below, a skill learned from their mother.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': "‘You Can’t Just Walk Away': Why Paula Bronstein Keeps Photographing Afghanistan", 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001-14)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bronstein, Paula (Photographer)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-15T09:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kim Barker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61c8ba69-ddcd-586a-8d79-0694a79fa3b6', 'word_count': 1335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61c8ba69-ddcd-586a-8d79-0694a79fa3b6'}, {'abstract': 'The party’s nominee has not held a single event aimed at black voters in their communities, and has turned down numerous invitations to address black gatherings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/16/us/politics/donald-trump-black-voters.html', 'snippet': 'The party’s nominee has not held a single event aimed at black voters in their communities, and has turned down numerous invitations to address black gatherings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Donald J. Trump went to Detroit last week to deliver a speech on his economic proposals, he laid the chronic problems of the heavily black city at the feet of his opponents, saying Democrats had a strang