ok silver and bronze, respectively, on the balance beam.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/15/sports/olympics/rio-schedule-results.html', 'snippet': 'Miller, from the Bahamas, beat American Allyson Felix by 0.07 seconds. Americans Laurie Hernandez and Simone Biles took silver and bronze, respectively, on the balance beam.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a desperate lunge at the finish line, Shaunae Miller of the Bahamas won the women’s 400 meters at the Rio Olympics on Monday night, defeating Allyson Felix of the United States.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 632}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 973, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/sports/16CITYTRACK1/16CITYTRACK1-supe