thought shopping should be easy, so he started producing ready-to-wear clothing made from sturdy, practical material that you could buy straight off the rack. The result was a new model that revolutionized the industry and shot Nehera to success. His brand flourished throughout the 1930s — at its height, there were 130 stores across Europe — until World War II brought things to a halt.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brand to Know: A Voluminous Line, Brought Back From the Past', 'kicker': 'On the Verge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lemaire (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-15T14:49:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Merrell Hambleton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Merrell', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hambleton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db8dcfdd-dfbe-528d-9970-2b2a0c86f4fd', 'word_count': 679, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db8dcfdd-dfbe-528d-9970-2b2a0c86f4fd'}, {'abstract': 'The experimental performance space in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, will feature new guest programmers, 30 newly commissioned works and the start of an online arts journal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/16/arts/music/national-sawdust-announces-second-season.html', 'snippet': 'The experimental performance space in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, will feature new guest programmers, 30 newly commissioned works and the start of an online arts journal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'National Sawdust, the experimental performance spa