1-a320-de18c500fbd1'}, {'abstract': 'Terrorism fatalities in the most dangerous countries in the world are falling. But deaths in North America and Western Europe, still rare, are up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/16/upshot/is-terrorism-getting-worse-in-the-west-yes-in-the-world-no.html', 'snippet': 'Terrorism fatalities in the most dangerous countries in the world are falling. But deaths in North America and Western Europe, still rare, are up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If it feels as if terrorism deaths are rising in the West, it’s because they are. Yet the numbers remain relatively small, and globally, deaths from terrorism appear to be declining, not rising.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Is Terrorism Getting Worse? In the West, Yes. In the World, No.', 'kicker': 'Public Safety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Is Terrorism Getting Worse? In West, Yes. In World, No.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanger-Katz, Margot', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-16T07:30:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margot Sanger-Katz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margot', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanger-Katz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cde3117f-9284-56de-a282-e0f2f195d012', 'word_count': 1085, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cde3117f-9284-56de-a282-e0f2f195d012'}, {'abstract': 'Former medalists weigh in on what kept them motivated during training.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomf