ge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/t-magazine/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/16/t-magazine/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/t-magazine/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 758, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/t-magazine/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F/gabriela-hearst-slide-RZ6F-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1516, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Home and Work: Gabriela Hearst', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hearst, Gabriela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uruguay', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-16T16:49:41+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/361367a3-9e73-5740-939e-b5e75614efe1', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/361367a3-9e73-5740-939e-b5e75614efe1'}, {'abstract': 'When she isn’t a Manhattan mother-cum-fashion designer, Hearst is an indomitable gaucho on her childhood ranch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/16/t-magazine/fashion/gabriela-hearst-uruguay-home-ranch.html', 'snippet': 'When she isn’t a Manhattan mother-cum-fashion designer, Hearst is an indomitable gaucho on her childhood ranch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Gabriela Hearst began dating her future husband Austin Hearst, scion of the publishing clan, they shared memories of growing up on their families’ ranches. Austin’s, of course, was San Simeon, the well-groomed coastal California spread (including the now-public Hearst Castle) where he rode the Arabians his family breeds. Gabriela recalls smiling back at him indulgently. “It sounded so nice,” she says, “but I was thinking, ‘No, I meant I grew up on a ranch.’\u2009”', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '178', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gabriela Hearst at Home, in Uruguay', 'kicker': 'Home and Work', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home on the Range ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ranches', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hass, Nancy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hearst, Gabriela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uruguay', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-16T16:50:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nancy Hass', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hass', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af441a62-e5fe-503a-9fae-f07073d9fa78', 'word_count': 781, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af441a62-e5fe-503a-9fae-f07073d9fa78'}, {'abstract': 'Regulators are stuck in an outdated view of the world, while the internet giants are more attuned to the threat of nascent competitors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/17/business/dealbook/expect-little-antitrust-challenge-to-walmarts-bid-for-jet-com.html', 'snippet': 'Regulators are stuck in an outdated view of the world, while the internet giants are more attuned to the threat of nascent competitors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Walmart’s $3.3 billion acquisition of Jet.com can be expected to sail through antitrust review, eliciting barely a peep of objection from the federal government.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPROF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPROF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPROF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPROF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPROF-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPROF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/business/17DB-DEALPROF/17DB-DEALPRO