m/2016/08/17/us/politics/tim-kaine-campaign.html', 'snippet': 'For a vice-presidential candidate who was often described as being “boring,” Mr. Kaine seemed more than comfortable during a night out in Asheville, N.C.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ASHEVILLE, N.C. — Senator Tim Kaine played the harmonica. His wife gave an impromptu clogging performance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tim Kaine Lets Loose on the Campaign Trail, With Music, Beer and Fun', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaine, Timothy M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holton, Anne (1958- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vice Presidents and Vice Presidency (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Asheville (NC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-16T17:30:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3fea31e6-2af0-5c7d-a87b-eac51ee8a1f6', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fea31e6-2af0-5c7d-a87b-eac51ee8a1f6'}, {'abstract': 'A national security expert explains why some of Mr. Trump’s anti-terrorism proposals don’t hold water.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/08/16/why-donald-trumps-test-for-immigrants-wont-work/', 'snippet': 'A national security expert explains why some of Mr. Trump’s anti-terrorism proposals don’t hold water.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald Trump’s foreign-policy speech on Monday was more staid than some of his recent outings, but it didn’t necessarily make any more sense. In a recent interview, Anthony Cordesman, who holds the Arleigh A. Burke Chair in Strategy at the Center for Strategic and International Studies, helped evaluate some of Mr. Trump’s more unusual proposals. Mr. Cordesman, who focuses on national security and has worked on Middle Eastern issues for years, explained why an ideological test for immigrants won’t work, why the United States couldn’t have kept Iraq’s oil and what really led to the rise of ISIS.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16northWEB/16northWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16northWEB/16northWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16northWEB/16northWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16northWEB/16northWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16northWEB/16northWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16northWEB/16northWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/16/opinion/16no