ook/bribery-arrest-may-expose-african-mining-rights-scandal-tied-to-och-ziff.html', 'snippet': 'F.B.I. agents in Brooklyn arrested Samuel Mebiame, a consultant for an Och-Ziff Capital Management Group venture, on charges he paid bribes to African officials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The arrest of a Gabonese man on charges of bribing African officials may help pull back the curtain on a long-running foreign corruption scandal that has ensnared the giant hedge fund founded by Daniel Och.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bribery Arrest May Expose African Mining Rights Scandal Tied to Och-Ziff', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Adviser for Giant Fund Faces Bribery Charges Over Pursuit of Mining Rights in Africa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevenson, Alexandra', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mebiame, Samuel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Och-Ziff Capital Management Group LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Corrupt Practices Act (1977)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Och Ziff Capital Management Group', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-17T00:25:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Stevenson