, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pinterest', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-17T11:01:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sapna Maheshwari', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sapna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Maheshwari', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ef2b756-19a0-52f8-a1d1-6e50060d303e', 'word_count': 561, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ef2b756-19a0-52f8-a1d1-6e50060d303e'}, {'abstract': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: In August 1916, U.S. union leaders threaten national railroad strike.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/08/17/1916-threat-of-railroad-strike/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: In August 1916, U.S. union leaders threaten national railroad strike.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Wilson, deeming the situation in connection with the threatened railroad strike to be so acute that it must needs demand prompt and decisive action to avert a national disaster, has issued a call for all railroad presidents throughout the country to meet him in conference at the White House. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1916: Threat of Railroad Strike', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroads', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Woodrow', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-17T11:45:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/404fad7c-b41f-57b9-9ab9-5d0669e23481', 'word_count': 108, 'uri': 'nyt://article/404fad7c-b41f-57b9-9ab9-5d0669e23481'}, {'abstract': 'The founders of ContextMedia, a health care media company in Chicago, have helped other start-ups get through those perilous first years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/18/business/smallbusiness/an-ecosystem-where-start-ups-help-other-start-ups.html', 'snippet': 'The founders of ContextMedia, a health care media company in Chicago, have helped other start-ups get through those perilous first years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When start-ups begin, it’s akin to Joseph Campbell’s mythical hero’s journey. Instead of battling hydras and gorgons alone, entrepreneurs often help each other face obstacles like entrenched markets, financing and abject fear of failure.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/business/18EBIZ/18EBIZ-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Ecosystem Where Start-Ups Help Other Start-Ups', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Helping Hand for Start-Ups From Those Who’ve Been There Before', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ContextMedia Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shah, Rishi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Agarwal, Shradha', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venture Capital', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-17T11:50:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By John F. Wasik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Wasik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d87a71f-5f07-56a0-9caa-a22c7cd1aec5', 'word_count': 1190, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d87a71f-5f07-56a0-9caa-a22c7cd1aec5'}, {'abstract': 'In the little-known Slovak Tokaj region, they have been making wine since Roman times.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/21/travel/wine-slovakia-slovak-tokaj.html', 'snippet': 'In the little-known Slovak Tokaj region, they have been making wine since Roman times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leaves on the main road on a sunny September afternoon were a sure sign that summer in Slovakia was nearly over and that the grape harvest was about to begin. But although I expected a lot of buzz around the main Tokaj village called Mala Trna, there wasn’t a person in sight. Just some bees going about their business. In France and Italy, wine-producing regions like this one are full of tourists and winery owners promoting their products.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SLOVAKIA1/21SLOVAKIA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SLOVAKIA1/21SLOVAKIA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SLOVAKIA1/21SLOVAKIA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SLOVAKIA1/21SLOVAKIA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1380, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'imag