 U.S. cities face racial disorder in August 1966.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/08/17/1966-mayors-face-racial-troubles/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: Mayors of big U.S. cities face racial disorder in August 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — Troubles in the big cities across the country have put his honor the mayor on the firing line this summer. The mayor no longer can leave it to the president or the governor to solve his problems. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/18/blogs/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/18/blogs/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/18/blogs/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/18/blogs/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/18/blogs/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor/18oldiht-1966-bostonmayor-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1966: Mayors Face Racial Troubles', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub