2be81-1a14-5fc7-bf3f-d83dfac63d0a', 'word_count': 702, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7732be81-1a14-5fc7-bf3f-d83dfac63d0a'}, {'abstract': 'Donald J. Trump has shuffled his campaign leadership once again, this time appointing the head of the conservative website Breitbart News.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/18/us/politics/stephen-bannon.html', 'snippet': 'Donald J. Trump has shuffled his campaign leadership once again, this time appointing the head of the conservative website Breitbart News.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the American financial system collapsed in the fall of 2008, Stephen K. Bannon began to fantasize about destroying something else: the elite economic and political establishment that he believed had created the crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stephen Bannon, a Rookie Campaign Chief Who ‘Loves the Fight’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Campaign Rookie Steeped in Right-Wing Fury', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bannon, Stephen K', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Breitbart News Network LLC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-17T17:22:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro and Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fda9dcd-c347-5788-af9a-dd380599e61d', 'word_count': 1378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fda9dcd-c347-5788-af9a-dd380599e61d'}, {'abstract': 'A repurposed gasworks complex, built in the 19th century, has spurred a revival of the industrial neighborhood of Westerpark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/21/travel/five-places-to-go-in-amsterdam.html', 'snippet': 'A repurposed gasworks complex, built in the 19th century, has spurred a revival of the industrial neighborhood of Westerpark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In northwestern Amsterdam, an old gasworks complex has spurred a revival of the industrial neighborhood of Westerpark. Built in the 19th century, the Westergasfabriek hasn’t produced gas in decades, but its handsome red brick buildings have been repurposed to house creative projects ranging from an art house cinema to a trendsetting nightclub. Spruced-up outdoor areas host regular flea and food markets, and new bars, restaurants and shops now attract Amsterdammers from across the city. Meanwhile, the surrounding urban park beckons with its large grassy meadows, petting zoo and benches that double as art installations.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SURFACING2/21SURFACING2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SURFACING2/21SURFACING2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/travel/21SURFACING2/21SURFACING2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0