robot-season-2-episode-7-recap.html', 'snippet': 'Wednesday’s episode revealed what many had suspected: that Elliot’s mundane post-hack life was an elaborate mental deception.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No canned laughter, no “Full House” theme song, no retro commercials, no ALF cameo — and yet somehow I don’t think anyone will complain about a relative lack of narrative boldness in this week’s episode of “Mr. Robot.” Turns out it’s not just a 20-minute sojourn in sitcom land for which Elliot Alderson departed from reality this time around. He’s actually been living in a fantasy world all season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/watching/17robot/17robo