 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting Rights Act (1965)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Southern States (US)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-18T07:21:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deuel Ross', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deuel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ross', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e9b9e24-0535-58ac-b354-198f7ec491ae', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e9b9e24-0535-58ac-b354-198f7ec491ae'}, {'abstract': 'Both Mr. Trump and Mr. Pence opposed the bailout that helped save the auto industry. Our columnist disagrees, and he was there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/18/opinion/what-trump-doesnt-know-about-detroit.html', 'snippet': 'Both Mr. Trump and Mr. Pence opposed the bailout that helped save the auto industry. Our columnist disagrees, and he was there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No shortage of critics unleashed their weaponry eight years ago as the federal government intervened to save General Motors and Chrysler when they teetered near bankruptcy. Among the more notable: Mitt Romney, who’s well remembered for his 2008 New York Times Op-Ed article, “Let Detroit Go Bankrupt.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/18/opinion/18Rattner-web/18Rattner-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'cr