bstract': 'The Beach Sessions, at Rockaway Beach, bring contemporary dance to the water’s edge and work with organizations that help the environment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/21/arts/dance/beach-cleanup-and-dance-together-in-queens.html', 'snippet': 'The Beach Sessions, at Rockaway Beach, bring contemporary dance to the water’s edge and work with organizations that help the environment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Typically, dancers are barefoot, not their audiences. But at the Beach Sessions, at Rockaway Beach, spectators can wriggle their toes in the sand. Last year, the Rockaway resident Sasha Okshteyn started this free outdoor series to bring contemporary dance from city stages to the long shoreline of Queens. The effort is ecological as well as artistic: In pairing performance with beach cleanups and partnering with organizations like the Surfrider Foundation, Ms. Okshteyn is forging a dialogue between dance and its environs.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/21/arts/21GUIDE4/21GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 