icle/aa3b79b1-4a51-5564-9fea-63f3e5ebae6b', 'word_count': 622, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa3b79b1-4a51-5564-9fea-63f3e5ebae6b'}, {'abstract': 'Ralph Lauren’s first collection of round timepieces for women features Breguet-style hands and a bold combination of numerals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/18/t-magazine/fashion/ralph-lauren-womens-watch.html', 'snippet': 'Ralph Lauren’s first collection of round timepieces for women features Breguet-style hands and a bold combination of numerals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was women who pioneered wearing watches on the wrist. Queen Elizabeth was given an intricately bejeweled one by the Earl of Leicester in 1572; the Queen of Naples had a band made of hair and gold thread. While men continued to keep their watches in their pockets, sporty 19th-century ladies wore timepieces with leather straps while on horseback and bicycles. Ralph Lauren channels that intrepid spirit with his first collection of round watches for women, RL888, named for the address of his flagship Madison Avenue mansion. The selection features Breguet-style hands and a bold combination of Arabic and Roman numerals. Many have interchangeable straps, including this one made of slick black alligator.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '160', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 732}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 840, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1680, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/t-magazine/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0/21tmag-08qual_thing_watch-t_CA0-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Instantly Classic Women’s Watch', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Thing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Polo Ralph Lauren Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madison Avenue (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Watches and Clocks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-18T15:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nancy Hass', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hass', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/76cf3628-a4c9-5239-8023-4cbef6d409f4', 'word_count': 113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76cf3628-a4c9-5239-8023-4cbef6d409f4'}, {'abstract': 'Your cable provider can offer you a DVR to record your favorite programs, but TiVo’s hardware can do more than just time-shift your shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/19/technology/personaltech/comparing-digital-video-recorders.html', 'snippet': 'Your cable provider can offer you a DVR to record your favorite programs, but TiVo’s hardware can do more than just time-shift your shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. What are the pros and cons of getting a TiVo digital video recorder for the television instead of using the hardware pushed by my cable company?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Comparing Digital Video Recorders', 'kicker': 'Tech Tip', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Digital Video Recorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television Sets and Media Devices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TiVo Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-18T15:01:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. D. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/44299035-e7e0-5e7e-b540-208f5798e4b7', 'word_count': 347, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44299035-e7e0-5e7e-b540-208f5798e4b7'}, {'abstract': 'Ivy Mix, a decorated master of cocktails, worked with her father on a new line of in-demand vessels, handmade in Vermont.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/18/t-magazine/design/ivy-mix-leyenda-glasses.html', 'snippet': 'Ivy Mix, a decorated master of cocktails, worked with her father on a new line of in-demand vessels, handmade in Vermont.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’ve been to Leyenda, the Brooklyn cocktail joint known for jalapeño-infused tequila tipples and tiki-inspired pisco potions, you’ve likely met Ivy Mix — or at least enjoyed her drinks. She runs the bar with her partner Julie Reiner (both are highly decorated in the world of mixology; last year, Mix won Best American Bartender at the Oscars of the spirits industry, Tales of the Cocktail); and despite Leyenda’s success, it’s just one aspect of Mix’s resume. Much of her time is spent on the road managing Speed Rack, the femme-focused national cocktail competition she co-founded in 2011. And this month, she launches a new venture: a new line of barware created in partnership with her father, Robin Mix, a glassblowing artist based in rural Vermont.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/t-magazine/17tmag-ivymix-01/17tmag-ivymix-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/17/t-magazine/17tmag-ivymix-01/17tmag-ivymix-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/t-magazine/17tmag-ivymix-01/17tmag-ivymix-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/17/t-magazine/17tmag-ivymix-01/17tmag-ivymix