ec6fc5-228f-522e-84d0-23907c29ecc7'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Schumer, a champion of women’s causes, is being criticized for comments about women from Kurt Metzger, a contributor to her television show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/19/arts/television/amy-schumer-kurt-metzger-sexual-assault-comments.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Schumer, a champion of women’s causes, is being criticized for comments about women from Kurt Metzger, a contributor to her television show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent years, Amy Schumer has emerged as one of comedy’s biggest stars, a performer and writer who has used her visibility and Emmy Award-winning sketch series, “Inside Amy Schumer,” to call attention to a wide range of social issues that were once considered too uncomfortable to joke about, be they the chauvinistic depiction and discussion of women’s bodies in the media or the public’s unwillingness to believe sexual assault charges made against Bill Cosby.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/arts/19SCHUMER2/19SCHUMER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/19/arts/19SCHUMER2/19SCHUMER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/arts/19SCHUMER2/19SCHUMER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/arts/19SCHUMER2/19SCHUMER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im