icle/9968e179-d9a9-5520-9a91-4a8dcf74c268'}, {'abstract': 'News organizations should not be forced to turn over unpublished reporting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/19/opinion/the-bowe-bergdahl-case-and-other-threats-to-the-press.html', 'snippet': 'News organizations should not be forced to turn over unpublished reporting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cases against Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl, who is accused of being an Army deserter and is being prosecuted in military court, and Nasean Bonie, a former building superintendent in the Bronx who was recently convicted of killing a tenant, have little in common. But litigation stemming from both could set a dismal precedent for press freedoms by broadening the criteria under which prosecutors are allowed to obtain unpublished material gathered by journalists.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/opinion/19fri1/19fri1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/19/opinion/19fri1/19fri1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/opinion/19fri1/19fri1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/opinion/19fri1/19fri1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/19/opinion/19fri1/19fri1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/19/opinion/19fri