le/cac2d12c-970b-51c0-a55f-4bb93296895b'}, {'abstract': 'A white 19-year-old college student was arrested after being accused of killing two strangers and chewing on one victim’s face. But activists say if the suspect were black, he would not have survived.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/20/us/activists-see-racial-bias-in-suspects-treatment-after-gruesome-florida-killing.html', 'snippet': 'A white 19-year-old college student was arrested after being accused of killing two strangers and chewing on one victim’s face. But activists say if the suspect were black, he would not have survived.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While investigators in Florida are struggling to understand what prompted an attacker to approach two strangers this week, stab and beat them to death, and then chew on one victim’s face, many activists see racial bias in the way the police treated the suspect, a white 19-year-old college student.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/us/20flakka_xp/20flakka_xp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 222, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/us/20flakka_xp/20flakka_xp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 222, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/us/20flakka_xp/20flakka_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/20/us/20flakka_xp/20flakka_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/us/20flakka_xp/20flakka_xp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Activists See Racial Bias in Suspect’s Treatment After Gruesome Florida Killing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-19T18:36:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Rogers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rogers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9695e993-20c9-5191-b5dc-e38874d60405', 'word_count': 892, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9695e993-20c9-5191-b5dc-e38874d60405'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Varella and Ms. Junqueira spend some time relaxing with their two sons, but most of their day is devoted to running their Brazilian eatery, Beach Bistro 96.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/21/nyregion/how-carlos-varella-and-andressa-junqueira-rockaways-restaurateurs-spend-their-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Varella and Ms. Junqueira spend some time relaxing with their two sons, but most of their day is devoted to running their Brazilian eatery, Beach Bistro 96.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sweethearts of the Rockaway food scene this summer, Carlos Varella and Andressa Junqueira, run the Brazilian restaurant Beach Bistro 96 out of a spruced-up shanty virtually within earshot of the surf. Their corner often resembles a cocktail party for the scantily clad, as guests wait for orders, or a seat inside. “Everyone likes to be there. The music is very nice. We play bossa nova,” said Ms. Junqueira, 33. She and Mr. Varella, 42, are Brazilian but met in Mexico City while working as models (Ms. Junqueira is still a model). The couple live with their sons, Nicolas, 8, and Kalani, 8 months, in an apartment near the restaurant. For this interview, Ms. Junqueira did the talking.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 470, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 470}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1603, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/21/nyregion/21ROUTINE1/21ROUTINE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'head