oundary Waters Canoe Area  in the northern part of the state, a place with lakes with names like Saganaga, Fall, Sucker, Moose and Newfound. Their journey’s focus was Basswood Lake, a choice Ms. Nowak said had been inspired by an old photo of their paternal grandfather in which he stands before what is believed to be the oldest tree in the state.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Working Through Their Issues, One Lake at a Time', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'You Could Call It Lake Effect Love', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vows (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-19T18:58:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nina Reyes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reyes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77b2a1cf-dd0c-5e60-9381-6942c63fcd98', 'word_count': 1543, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77b2a1cf-dd0c-5e60-9381-6942c63fcd98'}, {'abstract': 'As aid and attention dwindle, more than 57,000 refugees remain stuck in Greece. Their route through the Balkans into Europe was closed off in March, and thousands now wait for their asylum applications to be processed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/europe/100000004601820/refugees-stuck-in-limbo-in-greece.html', 'snippet': 'As aid and attention dwindle, more than 57,000 refugees remain stuck in Greece. Their route through the Balkans into Europe was closed off in March, and thousands now wait for their asylum applications to be processed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As aid and attent