icized after giving a homeless man a few dollars in Melbourne this week, with some deriding it as a photo opportunity at odds with his policies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/20/world/australia/malcolm-turnbull-handout-spurs-debate-on-best-way-to-help-homeless-people.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister Malcolm Turnbull was criticized after giving a homeless man a few dollars in Melbourne this week, with some deriding it as a photo opportunity at odds with his policies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a simple gesture captured in a photograph: Malcolm Turnbull, the prime minister of Australia, leaning over and placing money in the paper cup of a homeless man in Melbourne this week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/world/20Turnbull_xp/20Turnbull_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/20/world/20Turnbull_xp/20Turnbull_xp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/world/20Turnbull_xp/20Turnbull_xp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/world/20Turnbull_xp/20Turnbull_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/20/world/20Turnbull_xp/20Turnbull_xp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/world/20Turnbull_xp/20Turnbull_xp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024