l', 'snippet': 'An airport’s size, passenger capacity and modernization in its bag handling all play a role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Your plane reached its destination along with your checked bags.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'You’ve Reached Baggage Claim, but Why Hasn’t Your Luggage?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Plane’s on Time. Why Isn‘t the Bag?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Negroni, Christine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Luggage and Packing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Delta Air Lines Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-22T01:58:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Negroni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Negroni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/891dffd6-93d0-521f-96e9-623a83a73a19', 'word_count': 320, 'uri': 'nyt://article/891dffd6-93d0-521f-96e9-623a83a73a19'}, {'abstract': 'Airlines and airport managers aim to decrease the incidence of missing bags by using radio frequency identification chips.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/23/business/chip-technology-keeps-checked-luggage-in-check.html', 'snippet': 'Airlines and airport managers aim to decrease the incidence of missing bags by using radio frequency identification chips.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent Southwest Airlines flight from Baltimore, Shvilla Rasheem arrived in Indianapolis, but her luggage did not.', 'print_section': 'B', 'pri