 'word_count': 1358, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fba6939-4c23-5735-8b1f-969b7ef91242'}, {'abstract': 'The cellphone game, popular with children and adults, has been added to a list of restrictions that New York State parolees must sign before being released.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/22/nyregion/civil-libertarians-skeptical-of-rule-banning-sex-offenders-from-pokemon-go.html', 'snippet': 'The cellphone game, popular with children and adults, has been added to a list of restrictions that New York State parolees must sign before being released.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The list that most sex offenders must sign in order to be granted parole in New York State includes many stipulations, all written in the first person. There are promises to register with local law enforcement, to complete therapy if it is required and to not pick up hitchhikers or visit schools or playgrounds.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/nyregion/20POKEMONGO1/20POKEMONGO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/20/nyregion/20POKEMONGO1/20POKEMONGO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/nyregion/20POKEMONGO1/20POKEMONGO1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/20/nyregion/20POKEMONGO1/20POKEMONGO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/20/nyregion/20POKEMONGO1/20POKEMONGO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'x