o be unfounded. But political polarization and economic and security concerns linger.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/22/sports/olympics/closing-ceremony-rio-games.html', 'snippet': 'The Olympics were seen as a triumph by many in Brazil, and some of the worst fears were shown to be unfounded. But political polarization and economic and security concerns linger.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — The skies opened on Sunday night over Maracanã, the stadium where Brazil bade farewell to the Rio Olympics with a spectacle celebrating everything from the giants of Brazilian music to the rock art drawn by tribesmen thousands of years ago, as if the heavens were lamenting the end of the 17-day sports extravaganza.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/sports/22olympics-main/22olympics-main-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/22/sports/22olympics-main/22olympics-main-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 563}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/sports/22olympics-main/22olympics-main-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/sports/22olympics-main/22olympics-main-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1921, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/sports/22olympics-main/22olympics-main-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': '