.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/dining/pie-dominique-ansel.html', 'snippet': 'A pie marathon: salted-carmel apple, flambéed banana cream, blackberry with roasted hazelnut crumble, heirloom tomato with fresh ricotta and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pastry chef Dominique Ansel is holding a pie marathon next month, with 11 kinds of pie to sample, including a few savory kinds. Salted-caramel apple, flambéed banana cream, blackberry and gin with roasted hazelnut crumble, and heirloom tomato with fresh ricotta are a few of the choices. Homemade ice cream, warm apple cider and a sneak peek at a new treat are included: Pie Nights; Sept. 14, 15, 21, 22, 28 and 29; one-hour sessions from 7 to 10 p.m.; tickets, $45 a person starting at noon on Wednesday from daevents.tocktix.com, Dominique Ansel Kitchen, 137 Seventh Avenue South (West 10th Street).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PIES-WEB/24BURNER-PIES-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PIES-WEB/24BURNER-PIES-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PIES-WEB/24BURNER-PIES-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PIES-WEB/24BURNER-PIES-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PIES-WEB/24BURNER-PIES-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewi