course before he retires. He’s been at it for 40 years with his Windows on the World Wine School, so-called because his classes started at that legendary restaurant. Since Sept. 11, 2001, they have been in Midtown, but he has kept the name. This is your last chance to experience Mr. Zraly on his favorite subject. Grab it: Windows on the World Wine School, Mondays from Sept. 26 to Oct. 24, and Nov. 1, 7 and 14, 7 to 9 p.m., JW Marriott Essex House, 160 Central Park South (Seventh Avenue); $1,200 a person from kevinzraly.com, 845-255-1456. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 761, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 817, 'width': 1100, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB/24BURNER-CLASS-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumb