ticle/03b9d729-ab71-5636-a485-3a23ad4c012d', 'word_count': 1261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03b9d729-ab71-5636-a485-3a23ad4c012d'}, {'abstract': 'One blade for soft foods, like peaches and tomatoes; another for potatoes and carrots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/dining/vegetable-peeler-fruit-urban-trend.html', 'snippet': 'One blade for soft foods, like peaches and tomatoes; another for potatoes and carrots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The serrated vegetable peeler that can tackle soft foods like tomatoes and peaches was first introduced in 2003 and quickly became a favorite in my kitchen. Now there’s a new peeler, with both serrated and straight blades, an all-in-one treasure: Urban Trend peeler, $14.99 at Bed Bath & Beyond, bedbathandbeyond.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB/24BURNER-PEELER-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 803}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'cre