se and on the palate, with the kind of dry finish you get from good cider. It melts beautifully, so use it for grilled cheese with a thin slice of apple tucked inside, shave some on top of baked apples, or serve it with an apple tart: Rebollín Cider Fusion, $15.75 for a cheese, about one pound, at Despaña Foods in Manhattan 212-219-5050, and in Jackson Heights, Queens, 718-779-4971.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/dining/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB/24BURNER-CHEESE-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg'