0317f'}, {'abstract': 'The anonymous woman, accompanied by a friend, set out to highlight the restrictions placed on the procedure in Ireland, putting new pressure on the government to respond to calls for change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/world/europe/irish-woman-live-tweets-trip-to-get-abortion-in-england.html', 'snippet': 'The anonymous woman, accompanied by a friend, set out to highlight the restrictions placed on the procedure in Ireland, putting new pressure on the government to respond to calls for change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two Irish women who live-tweeted a trip to England so that one of them could get an abortion set off a debate over the weekend, highlighting the restrictions placed on the procedure in their home country and renewing pressure on the government to respond to calls for change.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/22/world/23xp-twowomen/23xp-twowomen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Irish Woman Live-Tweets Trip to Get Abortion in England', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ireland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kenny, Enda', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-23T12:19:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec9dcec4-30fb-5a2d-9dc0-1eb8179ea609', 'word_count': 915, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec9dcec4-30fb-5a2d-9dc0-1eb8179ea609'}, {'abstract': 'A federal court will hear arguments Wednesday in a suit to stop the Dakota Access pipeline, which the Standing Rock Sioux tribe says threatens water supplies and sacred lands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/us/occupying-the-prairie-tensions-rise-as-tribes-move-to-block-a-pipeline.html', 'snippet': 'A federal court will hear arguments Wednesday in a suit to stop the Dakota Access pipeline, which the Standing Rock Sioux tribe says threatens water supplies and sacred lands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEAR CANNON BALL, N.D. — Horseback riders, their faces streaked in yellow and black paint, led the procession out of their tepee-dotted camp. Two hundred people followed, making their daily walk a mile up a rural highway to a patch of prairie grass and excavated dirt that has become a new kind of battlefield, between a pipeline and American Indians who say it will threaten water supplies and sacred lands.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Occupying the Prairie: Tensions Rise as Tribes Move to Block a Pipeline', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tension on the Plains as Tribes Move to Block a Pipeline', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Native Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Dakota', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Energy Transfer Partners LP', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Dakota', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-23T12:33:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edccaf8b-434c-56ca-a809-985c8e545667', 'word_count': 1286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edccaf8b-434c-56ca-a809-985c8e545667'}, {'abstract': 'How social media helped a movement against sexual harassment and domestic violence break the taboo of silence.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/opinion/the-day-peruvian-women-rebelled.html', 'snippet': 'How social media helped a movement against sexual harassment and domestic violence break the taboo of silence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As in other days, the day I rebelled I was walking home from school by myself. I was 13, and I liked to wear the skirt of that godawful Peruvian school uniform above my knees. I loved my legs, and I had recently waxed them for the first time. It was Lima in the 1990s, I was crossing a street avoiding illegally parked cars shining under weak rays of sunshine and I did not even see it coming. All I felt was a burst of discomfort, a whiplash of shame. A hand slightly raising the skirt, brushing my thigh, trying to reach me. It lasted a few seconds. Like every time I experienced a “metida de mano” — a local institution of sexual harassment — I froze and muted an agonized scream.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 636}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 966, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/24Wiener/-24Wiener-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1932, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Day Peruvian Women Rebelled', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Day Peruvian Women Rebelled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Peru', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-23T12:41:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabriela Wiener', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabriela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wiener', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/510bc7a8-b78c-59a0-9fa9-ff21eb3bad13', 'word_count': 1101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/510bc7a8-b78c-59a0-9fa9-ff21eb3bad13'}, {'abstract': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: 120-year-old parrot, Cocky Bennett, dies in Australia in August 1916.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/08/23/1916-parrot-age-120-passes-away/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: 120-year-old parrot, Cocky Bennett, dies in Australia in August 1916.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — News has been received here that ‘‘Cocky Bennett,’’ probably the Mathusalah of the parrot world, has just died in Australia at the ripe age of 120 years. ‘‘Cocky’’ was born in 1796 in the neighbourhood of Sydney. Old age greatly deformed the bird’s once ‘‘cocky’’ head. The skin fell in folds, and his upper beak grew to an abnormal length. The centenarian, nevertheless, retained his activity and gaiety to almost the last, for he received visitors with a cheery cry of ‘‘Welcome, gentlemen.’’ — The New York Herald, European Edition, Aug. 24, 1916', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/24oldiht-1916-parrot/24oldiht-1916-parrot-jumbo.png', 'height': 672, 'width': 450, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/24oldiht-1916-parrot/24oldiht-1916-parrot-superJumbo.png', 'height': 672, 'width': 450, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/24oldiht-1916-parrot/24oldiht-1916-parrot-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/24oldiht-1916-parrot/24oldiht-1916-parrot-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/24oldiht-1916-parrot/24oldiht-1916-parrot-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1916: Parrot, Age 120, Passes Away', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AUSTRALIA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-23T13:10:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a240f22-1df6-5b16-90ce-d7e680adcc38', 'word_count': 96, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a240f22-1df6-5b16-90ce-d7e680adcc38'}, {'abstract': 'The Court of Arbitration for Sport rejected an appeal by Russia, confirming that none of the country’s athletes would participate in the Games that begin on Sept. 7.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/sports/russia-paralympic-games-ban.html', 'snippet': 'The Court of Arbitration for Sport rejected an appeal by Russia, confirming that none of the country’s athletes would participate in the Games that begin on Sept. 7.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — The highest court for world sports has upheld the decision to ban Russia from the Paralympic Games because of widespread doping, rejecting an appeal by the country and issuing what is considered the final word on the matter.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court Upholds Doping-Related Ban on Russia at Paralympics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sports Court Upholds Doping-Related Ban on Russian Athletes at Paralympics', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paralympic Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Court of Arbitration for Sport', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Paralympic Committee', 'rank': 5, 'majo