and-clinton-healthy/', 'snippet': 'A doctor who studies the history of presidents’ ailments calls for more transparency from the candidates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald Trump has begun questioning Hillary Clinton’s health, arguing recently that she lacks the “strength and stamina” to lead. When it comes to his own health, however, Mr. Trump has released only a bizarre letter from his doctor Harold Bornstein, which contains little medical detail. Mrs. Clinton has released a more detailed letter. In an interview, Dr. Robert Lahita, a professor of medicine at Rutgers University who has studied the history of presidential ailments, spoke about past presidents’ efforts to keep their illnesses under wraps and the need for more transparency.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/23northWEB/23northWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/23northWEB/23northWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/23northWEB/23northWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 561, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/23northWEB/23northWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1123, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/23northWEB/23northWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/23/opinion/23northWEB/23northWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb