 created the full-body swimsuit, said her invention was about “freedom and happiness.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — The woman credited with creating  the so-called burkini said the controversy over efforts to ban the full-body bathing suit worn by some Muslim women has helped bolster demand for her invention, which she said was not meant to be a political statement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25australia01/25australia01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Burkini’ Inventor Says Sales Have Skyrocketed on Heels of Controversy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Swimsuit’s Creator Says Sales Have Skyrocketed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslim Veiling', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bathing Suits and Swimwear', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zanetti, Aheda', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-24T14:48:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Australia', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Ives', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ives', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04b60ba2-bf05-5c1e-8aca-96d261818df9', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04b60ba2-bf05-5c1e-8aca-96d261818df9'}, {'abstract': 'The project is a collaboration among the choreographer Jonathan Burrows, the composer Matteo Fargion and the video artist Hugo Glendinning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/28/arts/dance/at-52-portraits-the-stories-behind-the-dancers.html', 'snippet': 'The project is a collaboration among the choreographer Jonathan Burrows, the composer Matteo Fargion and the video artist Hugo Glendinning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It can be hard to articulate all that goes into becoming and being a dancer, but the project known as 52 Portraits does so on a refreshingly human scale, without oversimplifying. A collaboration among the choreographer Jonathan Burrows, the composer Matteo Fargion and the video artist Hugo Glendinning, the digital series, produced by Sadler’s Wells in London, captures the thoughts and histories of its subjects through short autobiographical solos, one released every Monday of 2016.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At 52 Portraits, the Stories Behind the Dancers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dance; The Tales Behind the Steps', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sadler's Wells", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burrows, Jonathan (1960- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fargion, Matteo (1961- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glendinning, Hugo', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-24T14:59:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Siobhan Burke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Siobhan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c25c60df-c625-577f-ad2f-74fc0b251b74', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c25c60df-c625-577f-ad2f-74fc0b251b74'}, {'abstract': 'In 1903 Teddy Roosevelt dropped politics and took a hike. One result was the National Park system.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/time-to-follow-teddy-roosevelts-advice-drop-politics-and-enjoy-a-park/', 'snippet': 'In 1903 Teddy Roosevelt dropped politics and took a hike. One result was the National Park system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Somewhere not far from any American, it’s possible to visit one of this country’s most remarkable assets – its national parks. And from August 25 to 28, as part of this year’s celebration of the 100th year of the National Park System, you can do so free of charge. Of the 400-plus parks in the system,\xa0124 normally charge an entrance fee. You can find the nearest park here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 103, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 103}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 176, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/blogs/dotacadia1/dotacadia1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Time to Follow Teddy Roosevelt’s Advice: ‘Drop Politics’ and Enjoy a Park', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k