rack of her stunning second album, “The Dreaming Room” (Columbia). The track, “Who I Am,” lyrically consists of just four short lines, leading irresistibly to this assertion. Ms. Mvula means for the message to stick.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1116, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1116}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 551, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1101, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE6/28GUIDE6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Laura Mvula Sings the Complicated Truth', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pop; She’s Sharing the Truth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value'