a-66d8717dc878'}, {'abstract': 'A siege stretches for hours after a bomb-and-gun attack at the campus in western Kabul, and many people were still thought to be trapped.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/25/world/asia/american-university-attack-kabul-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'A siege stretches for hours after a bomb-and-gun attack at the campus in western Kabul, and many people were still thought to be trapped.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — The American University of Afghanistan in Kabul came under attack by bomb and gunfire on Wednesday night, in a siege that lasted for hours as pockets of people trapped on campus tried to escape.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25KABUL/25KABUL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25KABUL/25KABUL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25KABUL/25KABUL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25KABUL/25KABUL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1296, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25KABUL/25KABUL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/25/world/25KABUL/25KABUL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capt