rible-colliery-explosion/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: An explosion in a colliery near Merfhyr, Wales, kills 2 in August 1891.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — About 2.30 yesterday afternoon, a terrific explosion occurred in the Abercanaid pit, belonging to Hill’s Plymouth Company, near Merfhyr. The detonation was so great as to alarm the whole neighborhood, and people rushed to the pit’s mouth. There were between fifty and sixty men in the pit at the time, and fears were entertained lest the whole had perished. Events, however, proved that excepting two men all were safe. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 25, 1891', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1891: Terrible Colliery Explosion', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines, Explosive', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wales', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-24T15:52:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/496ec142-4c17-50f5-b1d0-5ffdd96ac70a', 'word_count': 81, 'uri': 'nyt://article/496ec142-4c17-50f5-b1d0-5ffdd96ac70a'}, {'abstract': 'The festival will run a full week, Oct. 8 through Oct. 15, and feature many free events, including a jazz-movie program hosted by Nelson George.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/25/arts/music/bric-jazzfest-second-season.html', 'snippet': 'The festival will run a full week, Oct. 8 through Oct. 15,