nternational companies. It runs through Sept. 18.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/28/theater/looking-for-adventurous-theater-try-the-dream-up-festival.html', 'snippet': 'This program at Theater for the New City will include 19 new works from American and international companies. It runs through Sept. 18.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What’s that? You haven’t gotten your fill of offbeat theater at the New York International Fringe Festival, which ends Sunday, Aug. 28? Fear not: The annual Dream Up Festival, at Theater for the New City, begins the same day. A perhaps lesser-known but hardly less adventurous event, Dream Up will include 19 new works from American and international companies.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE7/28GUIDE7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 549, 'width': 296, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE7/28GUIDE7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 549, 'width': 296, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE7/28GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/28/arts/28GUIDE7/28GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking for Adventurous Theater? Try the Dream Up Festival', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Theater; Adventurous and Inventive', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Theater for the New Cit