role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7361f6bf-e5a9-5df0-8c5f-031376eb9044', 'word_count': 869, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7361f6bf-e5a9-5df0-8c5f-031376eb9044'}, {'abstract': 'Angel Olsen leaves her comfort zone in her new album, “My Woman.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/t-magazine/entertainment/angel-olsen-my-woman.html', 'snippet': 'Angel Olsen leaves her comfort zone in her new album, “My Woman.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Angel Olsen’s third full-length album, “My Woman,” out next week, may raise the eyebrows of fans expecting the singer-songwriter’s trademark earthy, folky sound. In the video for “Intern,” the opening track, which Olsen directed herself, she wears a silver tinsel wig, her voice floating and trembling over a blazing synth line. “I like pushing myself,” says the 29-year-old. When she leaves her comfort zone in songwriting, she explains, “my voice does things other than it normally would. I hold back on something because it goes better with the song.” On the album, she explores the contradictions of a relationship and the process of breaking down ideals: “I dare you to understand / What makes me a woman.”', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '70', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/11tmag-09look_olsen-t_CA0/11tmag-09look_olsen-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 609, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/11tmag-09look_olsen-t_CA0/11tmag-09look_olsen-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 609}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/11/t-magazine/11tmag-09look_olsen-t_CA0/11tmag-09look_olsen-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1009, 'subType': 'jumbo', '