book will trace Mr. Odenkirk’s trajectory from Second City in Chicago to “Saturday Night Live,” “The Ben Stiller Show” and “Mr. Show With Bob and David,” as well as his role as Jimmy McGill (a.k.a. Saul Goodman) on the AMC crime drama “Breaking Bad” and the prequel series “Better Call Saul.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 463, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 463}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 790, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1453, 'width': 1884, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/odenkirk/odenkirk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bob Odenkirk to Write Comic Memoir', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bob Odenkirk, Memoirist', 'name': None, 'seo