.html', 'snippet': 'Our critic on the home stretch of the International Contemporary Ensemble’s project to perform 50 premieres at the Mostly Mozart Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Wagner meets Tinder”: Intimacy in the age of dating apps was the inspiration, the composer Wang Lu said in remarks from the stage, for her effervescent chamber concerto “Cloud Intimacy,” which received its world premiere on Tuesday at Merkin Concert Hall. This quirky and touching work for six instrumentalists ended on what might have been the first “selfie cadenza” for a cellphone-mugging clarinetist (Campbell MacDonald).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25ICE2/25ICE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 930, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25ICE2/25ICE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 930}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25ICE2/25ICE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 661, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25ICE2/25ICE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1322, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25ICE2/25ICE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25ICE2/25ICE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/25/arts/25IC