'nyt://article/9a00477f-fb7b-5e0c-afd0-88d795ed6803'}, {'abstract': 'Elliot’s absence from this episode has a destabilizing, disintegrating effect, sending the message that something is missing, off, wrong.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/24/arts/television/mr-robot-season-2-episode-8-recap.html', 'snippet': 'Elliot’s absence from this episode has a destabilizing, disintegrating effect, sending the message that something is missing, off, wrong.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most striking thing in this week’s episode of “Mr. Robot” wasn’t in this week’s episode of “Mr. Robot.” It’s Elliot Alderson, the mentally ill mastermind behind the hacker collective fsociety’s rapidly disintegrating plan to level the world’s economic playing field. For the first time in the history of the series, Elliot — and Rami Malek, the wide-eyed actor whom the role has made a star — did not appear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/watching/24robot/24robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/24/watching/24robot/24robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/watching/24robot/24robot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/watching/24robot/24robot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/24/watching/24robot/24robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c