9-77dfc9fbc9be'}, {'abstract': 'When life gives you a big shedding pet, you’re not going to make lemonade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/28/magazine/judge-john-hodgman-on-knitting-dog-fur-into-a-scarf.html', 'snippet': 'When life gives you a big shedding pet, you’re not going to make lemonade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Josh writes: My girlfriend’s roommate Colette has a big, furry dog. She keeps all the fur it has shed in a Ziploc bag (three years’ worth!). She says she is planning to knit it into a scarf. She has no spinning knowledge or equipment, making her already-questionable goal untenable.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/magazine/28hodgman/28mag-28hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/28/magazine/28hodgman/28mag-28hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/magazine/28hodgman/28mag-28hodgman-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/magazine/28hodgman/28mag-28hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/28/magazine/28hodgman/28mag-28hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 596}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/magazine/28hodgman/28mag-28hodgman-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1017, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumb