f19938c'}, {'abstract': 'The building, in Chanhassen, Minn., also includes a music production complex and will open on Oct. 6.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/26/arts/music/prince-paisley-park-tours.html', 'snippet': 'The building, in Chanhassen, Minn., also includes a music production complex and will open on Oct. 6.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paisley Park, Prince’s storied private estate and music complex in Chanhassen, Minn., plans to open as a museum this fall, according to an announcement from the singer’s estate on Wednesday. Public tours are scheduled to begin on Oct. 6, with tickets going on sale starting this Friday, at OfficialPaisleyPark.com. The family is also planning an official tribute concert for Prince on Oct. 13 at U.S. Bank Stadium in Minneapolis.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/arts/26PAISLEY2-web/26PAISLEY2-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/26/arts/26PAISLEY2-web/26PAISLEY2-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/arts/26PAISLEY2-web/26PAISLEY2-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/arts/26PAISLEY2-web/26PAISLEY2-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/arts/26PAISLEY2-web/26PAISLEY2-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbS