/horse-racing/travers-stakes-midsummer-derby-exaggerator.html', 'snippet': 'With the 147th running of the Midsummer Derby near, the search for a Big Horse among racing’s glamour division, the 3-year-olds, continued.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SARATOGA SPRINGS, N.Y. — The Belmont Stakes winner Creator skipped over the racetrack like a school kid, his gray coat glimmering as if he were beneath a spotlight. The Preakness victor Exaggerator, a rangy colt with a commanding stride, quieted onlookers as he sauntered past like a gunslinger in a Hollywood western.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/sports/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/26/sports/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/sports/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/sports/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/sports/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/26/sports/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1/26-Y-jpPOSTCARD-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumb