es.com/2016/08/26/opinion/the-dumbed-down-democracy.html', 'snippet': 'A big chunk of the citizenry will vote despite being unable to accept basic facts needed to process this American life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are you smarter than an immigrant? Can you name, say, all three branches of government or a single Supreme Court justice? Most Americans, those born here, those about to make the most momentous decision in civic life this November, cannot. And most cannot pass the simple test aced by 90 percent of new citizens.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26Egan-web/26Egan-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Dumbed Down Democracy', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Dumbed Down Democracy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Egan, Timothy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-26T07:21:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Timothy Egan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Timothy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Egan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/210029ae-d6d5-5f10-b7da-2215aa6f7cf5', 'word_count': 846, 'uri': 'nyt://article/210029ae-d6d5-5f10-b7da-2215aa6f7cf5'}, {'abstract': 'In the Assembly district long represented by Sheldon Silver, voters appear to have a good choice of candidates to make a fresh start.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/26/opinion/winds-of-change-on-the-lower-east-side.html', 'snippet': 'In the Assembly district long represented by Sheldon Silver, voters appear to have a good choice of candidates to make a fresh start.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday evening, to a standing-room audience in an old theater on Grand Street on the Lower East Side, a drama played out that hasn’t been seen in the neighborhood in 40 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/26/opinion/26fri3web/26fri3web-articleLarge.j