fanning the racism of a community that tends to lurk in the shadows, the movement’s leaders could hardly contain their glee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Hillary Clinton assailed Donald J. Trump on Thursday for fanning the flames of racism embraced by the “alt-right,” the community of activists that tends to lurk anonymously in the internet’s dark corners could hardly contain its glee.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hillary Clinton Denounces the ‘Alt-Right,’ and the Alt-Right Is Thrilled', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Denounces ‘Alt-Right’ as Racist, and Factions Embrace the Spotlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fringe Groups and Movements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Right-Wing Extremism and Alt-Right', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-26T09:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Rappeport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rappeport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/035125d8-6829-5fdf-b24e-f02728536abf', 'word_count': 735, 'uri': 'nyt://article/035125d8-6829-5fdf-b24e-f02728536abf'}, {'abstract': 'Heather Bresch, defending her company against criticism for sharply increasing the price of the life-saving device, is unapologetic. “I am running a business,” she s