gust: These iPhone pictures (taken, by coincidence, mostly in those locations over a month of regular daily outings, and then posted to Twitter) constitute an informal diary of the ways that, even as strangers, we are at the unacknowledged center of one another’s existence. Like it or not, there is intimacy in our daily encounters with the millions who share our city, even if its duration is no longer than a glance or a shutter’s click.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Around the City in 10 Tweets', 'kicker': '#1LookADay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Central Idea', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Synagogue of New York', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-26T18:09:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Guy Trebay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Guy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trebay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb68c557-a989-58cd-80c7-662876849434', 'word_count': 106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb68c557-a989-58cd-80c7-662876849434'}, {'abstract': 'Olga Santos labored for years before she could open a restaurant of her own. Today, she serves an impressive variety of delicious Colombian dishes, from ceviches to steak to a sweet corn cake dessert.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/28/nyregion/review-colombian-homestyle-cooking-at-aqui-es-santa-fe.html', 