ue': 'Carlson, Gretchen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Clarence', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hill, Anita', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Environment', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-27T18:30:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bryce Covert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bryce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Covert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/35e49bf3-edae-5b3b-b7e0-b4a46b456cf6', 'word_count': 1099, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35e49bf3-edae-5b3b-b7e0-b4a46b456cf6'}, {'abstract': 'Did I learn from all those gaffes? Sort of.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/a-summer-to-make-mistakes.html', 'snippet': 'Did I learn from all those gaffes? Sort of.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I worried constantly about making mistakes, which, it turned out, did not prevent them. It was 1997, the summer I’d graduated from college, and I was interning with The Charlotte Observer, a daily newspaper in a city where I knew almost no one. I was a general assignment reporter earning $525 a week. If I performed well, I’d be considered for a permanent position.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 323, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 323}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 551, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/opinion/sunday/28sittenfeld/28sittenfeld-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1031, 'width': 1917, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Summer to Make Mistakes', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Summer to Make Mistakes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sittenfeld, Curtis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Internships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlotte Observer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-27T18:30:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Curtis Sittenfeld', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Curtis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sittenfeld', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None