.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/28/fashion/weddings/tracy-roosevelt-robert-oloughlin.html', 'snippet': 'The couple, who met at a pub nearly a decade ago, were married at Goodenough College in London.', 'lead_paragraph': "Theresa Marie Roosevelt, a daughter of Ann M. Roosevelt and James Roosevelt Jr. of Cambridge, Mass., was married Aug. 27 to Robert David James O'Loughlin, the son of Christine W. Hale of Brundall, England, and the late Robert G. O’Loughlin. Lorraine Redmond, a deputy registrar at the London Borough of Camden, officiated at Goodenough College in London. On Sept. 17, the Very Rev. Kevin J. O’Leary, a Roman Catholic priest, will lead a ceremony at St. Peter’s Parish in Cambridge, with the Rev. Leonard O’Malley, the church pastor, participating.", 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/fashion/weddings/28ROOSEVELT/28ROOSEVELT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/28/fashion/weddings/28ROOSEVELT/28ROOSEVELT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/fashion/weddings/28ROOSEVELT/28ROOSEVELT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/28/fashion/weddings/28ROOSEVELT/28ROOSEVELT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/28/fashion/weddings/28ROOSEVELT/28ROOSEVELT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': N