ree them from custody.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/29/world/asia/3-suspects-in-2009-attack-on-sri-lankan-cricket-team-are-killed-in-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'The police said the men, and a fourth militant, had died in a shootout when another group of militants tried to free them from custody.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — Four militants, three of whom were suspects in a 2009 attack on the Sri Lankan cricket team, were fatally shot in Lahore, Pakistan, when another group of militants tried to free them from custody, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/world/29pakistan-web1/29pakistan-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/30/world/29pakistan-web1/29pakistan-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/world/29pakistan-web1/29pakistan-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/world/29pakistan-web1/29pakistan-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/30/world/29pakistan-web1/29pakistan-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/world/29pakistan-web1/29pakistan-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption'