aura J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Game of Thrones (TV Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-29T16:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Games', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a91e2cf1-7932-5ec1-a3af-96e7c200c472', 'word_count': 487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a91e2cf1-7932-5ec1-a3af-96e7c200c472'}, {'abstract': 'These sweets, from L.A. Burdick Handmade Chocolates, come in five flavors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/31/dining/macaron-burdick-chocolate.html', 'snippet': 'These sweets, from L.A. Burdick Handmade Chocolates, come in five flavors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael Klug, the chef for L.A. Burdick Handmade Chocolates, has joined the macaron party, making a delicate, whisper-light version in five flavors: apricot, chocolate, lemon-blueberry, pistachio and cherry, with ganache, buttercream and jam fillings. All are made without artificial coloring. Buy them separately or in gift boxes of a dozen: Macaron Collection, $2.50 each, 12 for $30, L.A. Burdick stores, burdickchocolate.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnermacaron/31burnermacaron-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnermacaron/31burnermacaron-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnermacaron