584204160e78', 'word_count': 61, 'uri': 'nyt://article/176d6cd7-79d0-586b-9e35-584204160e78'}, {'abstract': 'Who’s responsible for your happiness onboard? In a new ad campaign, the airline tactfully says it’s you.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/30/business/media/great-fliers-make-the-best-of-their-situation-american-airlines-suggests.html', 'snippet': 'Who’s responsible for your happiness onboard? In a new ad campaign, the airline tactfully says it’s you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American Airlines wants you to know it would really, really appreciate it if you could ask before raising the window shade, and if you could not hog the armrest. Also, be nice to the flight attendants when they greet you.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/business/30ADCO/30ADCO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/30/business/30ADCO/30ADCO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/business/30ADCO/30ADCO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/business/30ADCO/30ADCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/30/business/30ADCO/30ADCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/business/30ADCO/30ADCO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'leg