h': 'Roger Vergé, the great French chef who died last year at 85, will be remembered for how he lit up the South of France with his Michelin three-star restaurant, Le Moulin de Mougins. On Sept. 12, he will be honored by chefs, most of whom worked with him, including Daniel Boulud, Terrance Brennan, Emeril Lagasse, Dean Fearing and Francis Mallmann, at a fund-raising dinner for a new Vergé scholarship to be awarded to a student at the Culinary Institute of America. The event will include a cocktail hour and four-course dinner: Roger Vergé Scholarship dinner, Sept. 12 at 6:30 p.m., Lighthouse at Chelsea Piers, 23rd Street and West Side Highway; tickets, $995 from blog.resy.com/verge-tribute-dinner.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnerchef/31burnerchef-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnerchef/31burnerchef-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnerchef/31burnerchef-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnerchef/31burnerchef-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 814, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnerchef/31burnerchef-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 814}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/dining/31burnerchef/31burnerchef-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 75