'nyt://article/0e941c15-efdb-5426-8b9d-7ff0b2f3a49e'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Wilder’s neurotic comic persona added a special edge to numerous hits, including “Blazing Saddles” and “Stir Crazy.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/30/movies/gene-wilder-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Wilder’s neurotic comic persona added a special edge to numerous hits, including “Blazing Saddles” and “Stir Crazy.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gene Wilder, who established himself as one of America’s foremost comic actors with his delightfully neurotic performances in three films directed by Mel Brooks; his eccentric star turn in the family classic “Willy Wonka and the Chocolate Factory”; and his winning chemistry with Richard Pryor in the box-office smash “Stir Crazy,” died early Monday morning at his home in Stamford, Conn. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gene Wilder Dies at 83; Star of ‘Willy Wonka’ and ‘Young Frankenstein’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gene Wilder, Star of ‘Young Frankenstein’ and ‘The Producers,’ Dies at 83', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, Daniel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilder, Gene', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-29T20:15:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel Lewis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lewis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_mat