-gotten-a-raise.html', 'snippet': 'Through a combination of low prices and moderate wage gains, 2015 may have been a great year for median household incomes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If there is one issue that both Hillary Clinton and Donald J. Trump can probably agree on this year, it’s the need to stop the fall of middle-class incomes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/upshot/up-income-census-1472504224134/up-income-census-1472504224134-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/30/upshot/up-income-census-1472504224134/up-income-census-1472504224134-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/upshot/up-income-census-1472504224134/up-income-census-1472504224134-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/upshot/up-income-census-1472504224134/up-income-census-1472504224134-articleLarge.png', 'height': 982, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/30/upshot/up-income-census-1472504224134/up-income-census-1472504224134-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 982}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/30/upshot/up-income-census-1472504224134/up-income-census-1472504224134-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 626, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '