ion is held in Dublin in August 1891.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/08/30/1891-amnesty-meeting-in-dublin/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of the International Herald Tribune: An amnesty demonstration is held in Dublin in August 1891.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An amnesty demonstration, attended by several thousand persons, was held in the Phoenix Park, Dublin, this afternoon, two platforms being erected in close proximity to the Viceregal Lodge. Resolutions were adopted calling upon the Government to release all prisoners undergoing penal servitude for political offences, and referring to the recent remedial legislation of the wrongs which provoked such offences. Copies were ordered to be forwarded to the Prime Minister, the Lord Lieutenant and Mr. Balfour. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 31, 1891', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/blogs/31oldiht-1891-dublin/31oldiht-1891-dublin-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/31/blogs/31oldiht-1891-dublin/31oldiht-1891-dublin-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/blogs/31oldiht-1891-dublin/31oldiht-1891-dublin-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/blogs/31oldiht-1891-dublin/31oldiht-1891-dublin-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/31/blogs/31oldiht-1891-dublin/31oldiht-1891-dublin-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargehe