1-2943b62c1ef3'}, {'abstract': 'Does Hillary Clinton deserve 91 percent of the black vote? Is Donald J. Trump even trying with black voters? We discuss with two New York Times journalists who have been covering this election and its racial dynamics: Charles Blow and Yamiche Alcindor. We also hear from Tara Wall, a campaign operative who helped President George W. Bush and Mitt Romney court black voters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2016/08/30/podcasts/30runup-black-vote.html', 'snippet': 'Does Hillary Clinton deserve 91 percent of the black vote? Is Donald J. Trump even trying with black voters? We discuss with two New York Times journalists who have been covering this election and its racial dynamics: Charles Blow and Yamiche Alci...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Does Hillary Clinton deserve 91 percent of the black vote? Is Donald J. Trump even trying with black voters? We discuss with two New York Times journalists who have been covering this election and its racial dynamics: Charles Blow and Yamiche Alcindor. We also hear from Tara Wall, a campaign operative who helped President George W. Bush and Mitt Romney court black voters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Black and White', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-08-30T14:03:25+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/4f68d00d-2cc2-5138-bf17-7e9e6d022b6c', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/4f68d00d-2cc2-5138-bf17-7e9e6d022b6c'}, {'abstract': 'We discuss how the candidates and their parties are (or are not) courting the black vote in this election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/30/podcasts/black-vote-clinton-trump.html', 'snippet': 'We discuss how the candidates and their parties are (or are not) courting t