ord_count': 579, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53565d63-7b36-5ba7-9acd-dc3d14286462'}, {'abstract': 'Three former faculty members were named by the head of the elite prep school after an investigation by a law firm, which examined cases from the 1970s and ’80s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/31/us/investigation-finds-phillips-faculty-engaged-in-sexual-misconduct-with-students.html', 'snippet': 'Three former faculty members were named by the head of the elite prep school after an investigation by a law firm, which examined cases from the 1970s and ’80s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five former faculty members at Phillips Academy in Andover, Mass., including a well-known writer, engaged in sexual misconduct with students in the 1970s and ’80s, the head of the school reported on Tuesday. It is the latest in a string of such revelations involving elite prep schools.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Investigation Finds Phillips Andover Faculty Engaged in Sexual Misconduct With Students', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Faculty Members Accused of Abuse at Phillips Andover', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Phillips Academy (Andover, Mass)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Theroux, Alexander', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wicks, Stephen', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palfrey, John Gorham Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private and Sectarian Schools', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-08-30T23:40:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'fi