_count': 816, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd89af98-e992-5ea7-b326-1bdcc62ea93f'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s task is not to try to persuade independents or Republicans that they should choose Mrs. Clinton, but to urge young voters and African-Americans to turn out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/08/31/us/politics/stumping-for-hillary-clinton-obama-will-urge-his-supporters-to-get-out-the-vote.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s task is not to try to persuade independents or Republicans that they should choose Mrs. Clinton, but to urge young voters and African-Americans to turn out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — One of President Obama’s top priorities during his last months in office is to help make sure that Hillary Clinton succeeds him. To do so, the president will make at least a dozen campaign appearances in battleground states from now to Election Day on Nov. 8.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/us/31OBAMA/31OBAMA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/08/31/us/31OBAMA/31OBAMA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/us/31OBAMA/31OBAMA-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/08/31/us/31OBAMA/31OBAMA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/08/31/us/31OBAMA/31OBAMA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'c